  "question": {
    "text": "One mole of an ideal gas passes through a process where pressure and volume obey the relation <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> . Here <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub></math> are constants. Calculate the change in the temperature of the gas if its volume changes from <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> to <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub></math> .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
